Package: mastermind-apt-config
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: apt (>= 3.0)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/MasterMindTIBR/apt
Description: configuração do repositório APT da MasterMind TI
 Instala a chave pública do repositório https://apt.mastermindti.cloud/debian,
 o arquivo /etc/apt/sources.list.d/mastermind.sources (canal stable ou
 testing, escolhido com mastermind-apt-channel) e o pin que faz o apt
 preferir os builds proxmox-backup-file-restore e proxmox-backup-restore-image
 publicados pela MasterMind.
